      50.88,
      439.27,
      286.68,
      571.74
    ],
    "text": "My No.: UDU/2/2/10/46. Land Ministry No.: L/03J/95/FR/190. I hereby give notice, under Sub section (1) of Section 7 of the Land Acquisition Act, as Amended by the land Acquisition (Amendment) Act, No. 28 of 1964, that the Government intends to acquire the following land/servitude for public purpose (the conservation of Knukles range).",
    "fonts": [
      "TimesNewRomanPS-BoldMT",
      "TimesNewRomanPS-ItalicMT",
      "TimesNewRomanPSMT"
    ],
    "sizes": [
      10.078991889953613,
      16.078292846679688,
      19.91800880432129
    ]
  },
  {
    "page_number": 0,
    "bbox": [
      50.88,
      585.6,
      286.66,
      686.23
    ],
    "text": "Description of the land/servitude to be acquired: An allotment of Land called \u2018Winchfield Park watta\u201d bearing an extent of about 5.6772 Hectares mentioned in P. P. Maha 6866, supplement of the Surveyor General, situated in the Grama Niladhari Division of Karambakatiya, in the Divisional Secretary\u2019s Division of Udadumbara of Kandy District, Central Province.",
    "fonts": [
      "TimesNewRomanPS-ItalicMT",
      "TimesNewRomanPSMT"
    ],
    "sizes": [
      10.078991889953613,
      35.99639892578125
