    ],
    "text": "A. V. B. Abeygunasekara - 3/B/3, Ihalawela, Kengalle. A. W. M. M. Abeygunasekara - 211/A, Akaravita, Gampaha A.V. S. Abeygunasekara - 21, Parakrama Samuddraya, Polonnaruwa A. V. H. Abeygunasekara - 169/6/A, Gamamada para, Raddoluwa, Seeduwa A. W. W. L. Abeygunasekara - 10G, Wagolla Road, Lewalla",
    "fonts": [
      "TimesNewRomanPSMT"
