    "bbox": [
      304.56,
      473.84,
      542.46,
      598.88
    ],
    "text": "All persons interested in the aforesaid land/servitude on which is to be acquired are herby required to appear Personally or by agents duty Outhorised in writing, before me at the Divisional Secretariat, Udadumbara on the 15th May 2019 at 11.00 a. m. And are hereby requested to notify to me in writing (in duplicate) on or before 08th May 2019 nature of their interests in the land, the particulars of their claims of compensation, for the acquisition of the said land, the amount of compensation and the details of the computation of such amount.",
